37
00:01:31,860 --> 00:01:36,950
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5"><font color="#cdcdcc">Everyone Comes With Me!</font></font>

38
00:01:31,860 --> 00:01:37,240
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5"><font color="#cdcdcc">A Takurami Survival of Sweat and Tears</font></font>

39
00:01:40,370 --> 00:01:42,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll do my best!</font>

40
00:01:43,040 --> 00:01:45,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Looks like it'll be interesting,
huh, Konohamaru?!</font>

41
00:01:47,620 --> 00:01:48,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Here... Here...</font>

42
00:01:50,210 --> 00:01:53,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hell no, hell no!
No way in hell!</font>

43
00:01:57,840 --> 00:02:01,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why should I have to do
some babysitting mission like that?</font>

44
00:02:01,850 --> 00:02:04,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't care what you say,
Grandma Tsunade. I refuse!</font>

45
00:02:04,810 --> 00:02:08,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The team organization has already
been announced to the students!</font>

46
00:02:09,310 --> 00:02:11,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't care about that!</font>

47
00:02:11,400 --> 00:02:13,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">As for me, I want to train more,
get stronger and...</font>

48
00:02:13,610 --> 00:02:17,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">"I'll become Hokage someday,"
huh?</font>

49
00:02:20,110 --> 00:02:21,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A person like that...</font>

50
00:02:21,160 --> 00:02:26,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">would never betray the expectations
of his adorable juniors, would he?</font>

51
00:02:26,330 --> 00:02:29,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Become a unit leader and
issue appropriate instructions...</font>

52
00:02:30,120 --> 00:02:33,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Protect the lives of your men
and promptly carry out your mission...</font>

53
00:02:34,130 --> 00:02:36,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I thought this mission
I'm giving you guys</font>

54
00:02:37,050 --> 00:02:40,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">is ideal practice for becoming Hokage.</font>

55
00:02:41,800 --> 00:02:43,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ideal practice for becoming... Hokage?</font>

56
00:02:45,010 --> 00:02:47,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you're going so far as to say that,
then it can't be helped...</font>

57
00:02:48,180 --> 00:02:48,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's too bad...</font>

58
00:02:49,020 --> 00:02:51,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Kidding, kidding,
kidding, just kidding!</font>

59
00:02:54,770 --> 00:02:57,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Say so sooner if that's the case.</font>

60
00:02:57,780 --> 00:02:59,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Practice for becoming Hokage...</font>

61
00:02:59,610 --> 00:03:02,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah, yeah...
That has a nice ring to it.</font>

62
00:03:03,320 --> 00:03:04,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He fell for it.</font>

63
00:03:05,030 --> 00:03:06,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Jeez, he's naive...</font>

64
00:03:07,040 --> 00:03:08,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto...</font>

65
00:03:08,750 --> 00:03:11,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now then,
my adorable team members are...</font>

66
00:03:17,000 --> 00:03:18,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">These guys?</font>

67
00:03:27,930 --> 00:03:31,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh! Why the heck are you
on that side?!</font>

68
00:03:31,560 --> 00:03:35,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Man, I don't want to do such
a troublesome mission either.</font>

69
00:03:35,980 --> 00:03:39,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shikamaru will be
an assistant to us instructors.</font>

70
00:03:40,820 --> 00:03:43,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I will now begin the explanation
of the outdoor training</font>

71
00:03:43,410 --> 00:03:45,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">to be conducted over
one night and two days.</font>

72
00:03:45,990 --> 00:03:48,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is the spot you all
will be setting out for.</font>

73
00:03:48,910 --> 00:03:52,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Great Stone Face of Warudakumi
on the summit of Mount Takurami.</font>

74
00:03:52,870 --> 00:03:56,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The team leader will not take routes
other than the ones indicated on the map</font>

75
00:03:56,340 --> 00:03:58,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">in order to ensure the safety
of the Academy students.</font>

76
00:03:59,510 --> 00:04:00,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Along the way
there will be obstacles,</font>

77
00:04:00,970 --> 00:04:02,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">such as instructors
disguised as enemy ninja,</font>

78
00:04:02,680 --> 00:04:04,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">as well as traps and the like.</font>

79
00:04:04,550 --> 00:04:06,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But you academy students
should be able to safely evade them</font>

80
00:04:06,850 --> 00:04:09,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">if you act according to the instructions
of your team leaders.</font>

81
00:04:12,190 --> 00:04:14,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You'll see
the Stone Face of Warudakumi</font>

82
00:04:14,270 --> 00:04:16,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">after you cover about
80 kilometers.</font>

83
00:04:16,770 --> 00:04:20,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The team that brings the secret document
hidden there back to the village</font>

84
00:04:20,320 --> 00:04:23,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">will have completed the training
upon crossing the finish line.</font>

85
00:04:24,030 --> 00:04:25,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There is only one secret document.</font>

86
00:04:26,280 --> 00:04:27,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This will be a competition
with the other teams.</font>

87
00:04:28,700 --> 00:04:32,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All right.
We'll finish first, no matter what!</font>

88
00:04:32,580 --> 00:04:33,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You guys ready?!</font>

89
00:04:33,830 --> 00:04:35,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah!</font>

90
00:04:42,260 --> 00:04:46,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">An important thing about survival is
acquiring food with your own resources.</font>

91
00:04:47,180 --> 00:04:52,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is called beef sashimi grass,
and it grows in this area.</font>

92
00:04:52,520 --> 00:04:53,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You can eat it raw,</font>

93
00:04:53,680 --> 00:04:56,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and it becomes precious food
when the chips are down.</font>

94
00:04:59,980 --> 00:05:02,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All right! All members acquire food!</font>

95
00:05:02,730 --> 00:05:04,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Yay!
— Yay!</font>

96
00:05:05,450 --> 00:05:06,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is it!</font>

97
00:05:07,450 --> 00:05:09,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let's eat...</font>

98
00:05:10,410 --> 00:05:14,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's blowfish sashimi grass.
It's a very similar poisonous grass.</font>

99
00:05:16,500 --> 00:05:20,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">See? The shape of the leaf
is a bit different, right?</font>

100
00:05:22,840 --> 00:05:25,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You two be careful as well, okay?</font>

101
00:05:25,050 --> 00:05:26,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Okay!
— Okay!</font>

102
00:05:30,180 --> 00:05:35,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Listen up, an important thing in survival
is to acquire food by your own resources.</font>

103
00:05:37,770 --> 00:05:39,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Something's not right!</font>

104
00:05:39,940 --> 00:05:41,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Disappointing, isn't it?</font>

105
00:05:42,400 --> 00:05:44,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I've got an uneasy feeling...</font>

106
00:05:48,870 --> 00:05:50,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let's see...</font>

107
00:05:50,870 --> 00:05:53,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The geography in this area
throws magnets out of kilter.</font>

108
00:05:54,040 --> 00:05:55,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">When you can't use a compass...</font>

109
00:05:58,210 --> 00:05:59,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're wearing a watch, right?</font>

110
00:05:59,790 --> 00:06:00,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh... yes!</font>

111
00:06:01,210 --> 00:06:02,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Look for the bisecting angle,</font>

112
00:06:02,500 --> 00:06:04,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">which divides the 12:00 direction</font>

113
00:06:04,630 --> 00:06:07,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and the current direction
of the hour hand in two...</font>

114
00:06:08,590 --> 00:06:12,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And then, when you line up that direction
with the sun as of now,</font>

115
00:06:13,220 --> 00:06:15,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the approximate 12:00 direction is south.</font>

116
00:06:16,770 --> 00:06:17,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Remember that!</font>

117
00:06:18,100 --> 00:06:19,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay!</font>

118
00:06:23,110 --> 00:06:24,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let's... see...</font>

119
00:06:30,660 --> 00:06:31,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This way...?</font>

120
00:06:31,530 --> 00:06:33,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, Konohamaru...</font>

121
00:06:33,200 --> 00:06:33,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This way?</font>

122
00:06:34,040 --> 00:06:35,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No doubt about it...</font>

123
00:06:36,330 --> 00:06:37,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's totally lost.</font>

124
00:06:38,210 --> 00:06:39,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Right, right!</font>

125
00:06:39,540 --> 00:06:42,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yikes. This is bad.</font>

126
00:06:43,040 --> 00:06:44,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All right! This way!</font>

127
00:06:45,170 --> 00:06:47,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Come with me!</font>

128
00:06:47,260 --> 00:06:49,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Will it be okay?</font>

129
00:06:58,600 --> 00:07:01,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That was a more challenging route
than I thought, wasn't it, guys?</font>

130
00:07:01,310 --> 00:07:04,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Challenging, my foot!
We're back at where we came from!</font>

131
00:07:05,110 --> 00:07:07,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Man, we can't trust you,
Brother Naruto!</font>

132
00:07:09,740 --> 00:07:11,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then why don't you try?!</font>

133
00:07:12,070 --> 00:07:13,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Give me that!</font>

134
00:07:15,660 --> 00:07:17,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh... It's this way.</font>

135
00:07:18,290 --> 00:07:20,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Not bad...</font>

136
00:07:21,250 --> 00:07:24,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's the matter, Konohamaru?!</font>

137
00:07:25,340 --> 00:07:28,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What are you doing, Konohamaru?!
Give me that!</font>

138
00:07:29,050 --> 00:07:30,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sorry... Here.</font>

139
00:07:32,640 --> 00:07:33,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let me see...</font>

140
00:07:34,430 --> 00:07:36,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, it's that way!</font>

141
00:07:37,220 --> 00:07:39,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What were you guys doing?!</font>

142
00:07:41,100 --> 00:07:43,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, we've come back again!</font>

143
00:07:43,270 --> 00:07:48,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What...? How in the world can
we get out of here?!</font>

144
00:07:48,440 --> 00:07:52,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All right... I'll do my best!</font>

145
00:08:01,870 --> 00:08:03,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't feel good...</font>

146
00:08:03,960 --> 00:08:05,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey!</font>

147
00:08:05,790 --> 00:08:07,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Good grief...</font>

148
00:08:19,850 --> 00:08:21,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Are you guys okay?</font>

149
00:08:21,430 --> 00:08:23,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes, Lee Sensei!</font>

150
00:08:24,230 --> 00:08:25,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What did you say... just now?!</font>

151
00:08:25,770 --> 00:08:27,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes, Lee Sensei!</font>

152
00:08:28,020 --> 00:08:31,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Lee Sensei...!
Ah, that has such a lovely ring to it.</font>

153
00:08:32,070 --> 00:08:35,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is youth, this is extreme youth!</font>

154
00:08:35,660 --> 00:08:38,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now, run towards that setting sun!</font>

155
00:08:38,160 --> 00:08:39,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes, Lee Sensei!</font>

156
00:08:39,790 --> 00:08:43,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Your sweat sparkling in
the setting sun is wonderful!</font>

157
00:08:43,250 --> 00:08:44,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes, Lee Sensei!</font>

158
00:08:51,300 --> 00:08:53,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Finally made it, huh...?</font>

159
00:08:53,800 --> 00:08:57,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now, I guess I'll check out
Naruto's team in action.</font>

160
00:08:59,890 --> 00:09:03,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now then... Show me what
you've learned until now!</font>

161
00:09:03,980 --> 00:09:04,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Go!</font>

162
00:09:05,270 --> 00:09:07,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All right! Formation One, Konohamaru!</font>

163
00:09:08,110 --> 00:09:09,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sexy Jutsu!</font>

164
00:09:10,190 --> 00:09:12,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Adults are a cinch with this Jutsu.</font>

165
00:09:14,650 --> 00:09:16,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You idiot!</font>

166
00:09:19,200 --> 00:09:20,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You wish, Brother Naruto!</font>

167
00:09:21,330 --> 00:09:23,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Times are evolving!</font>

168
00:09:23,620 --> 00:09:25,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">New formation!</font>

169
00:09:26,170 --> 00:09:27,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Cheesecake Jutsu!</font>

170
00:09:28,830 --> 00:09:31,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Fashion Model!</font>

171
00:09:32,050 --> 00:09:34,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Movie Star!</font>

172
00:09:34,670 --> 00:09:37,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Tanning Salon Receptionist!</font>

173
00:09:38,340 --> 00:09:40,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We're Cheesecakes!</font>

174
00:09:44,390 --> 00:09:47,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'd like to say, just what
I'd expect of my best pupils,</font>

175
00:09:47,600 --> 00:09:50,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">but you still don't have
enough "bust-waist-hip."</font>

176
00:09:52,230 --> 00:09:57,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Jeez, this guy's such a pain...
as always.</font>

177
00:10:10,040 --> 00:10:11,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Iruka-sensei!</font>

178
00:10:11,790 --> 00:10:12,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What is it?</font>

179
00:10:13,170 --> 00:10:14,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A report from the observatory...</font>

180
00:10:20,340 --> 00:10:22,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wow, it's warm.</font>

181
00:10:22,810 --> 00:10:26,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Good thing we listened to you
and prepared it ahead of time.</font>

182
00:10:26,560 --> 00:10:28,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We would've been soaked</font>

183
00:10:28,770 --> 00:10:30,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">if we were even a little slow
putting up the tent!</font>

184
00:10:30,810 --> 00:10:32,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Reading ahead is important for
a ninja...</font>

185
00:10:33,110 --> 00:10:36,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In particular, if you don't acutely
sense the weather,</font>

186
00:10:36,110 --> 00:10:37,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">it could end up being fatal,
so be careful.</font>

187
00:10:38,110 --> 00:10:39,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay!</font>

188
00:10:43,370 --> 00:10:46,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What're you doing, Moegi?
Pull it properly!</font>

189
00:10:48,960 --> 00:10:51,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I've had it!
I don't want to do this!</font>

190
00:10:51,080 --> 00:10:54,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Moegi! Stop saying selfish things
and hold it!</font>

191
00:10:54,130 --> 00:10:55,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But...</font>

192
00:11:01,010 --> 00:11:02,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What, really?!</font>

193
00:11:02,850 --> 00:11:05,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It seems it's going to directly hit
the Leaf Village before dawn.</font>

194
00:11:06,020 --> 00:11:07,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Jeez, why now...?!</font>

195
00:11:07,930 --> 00:11:09,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The communication from
the observatory</font>

196
00:11:09,270 --> 00:11:11,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">was probably delayed due to the storm.</font>

197
00:11:11,730 --> 00:11:12,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We have no choice, then.</font>

198
00:11:13,360 --> 00:11:14,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The training is suspended.</font>

199
00:11:15,070 --> 00:11:17,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Convey the order to all
the teams immediately!</font>

200
00:11:17,320 --> 00:11:17,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes, sir!</font>

201
00:11:21,280 --> 00:11:23,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why'd you put the tent away?!</font>

202
00:11:25,910 --> 00:11:28,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Brother Naruto, what's the deal?</font>

203
00:11:28,700 --> 00:11:30,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This path isn't on the map.</font>

204
00:11:31,040 --> 00:11:34,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We fell behind the others more
than I thought.</font>

205
00:11:34,590 --> 00:11:36,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We can't be resting.</font>

206
00:11:36,880 --> 00:11:38,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then, this path...</font>

207
00:11:38,840 --> 00:11:42,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah... It's not on the map.
It's a shortcut route!</font>

208
00:11:42,430 --> 00:11:43,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?!</font>

209
00:11:44,510 --> 00:11:46,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Will this be okay?!</font>

210
00:11:55,520 --> 00:11:58,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What are you doing?!
We'll be late if we don't hurry!</font>

211
00:12:00,610 --> 00:12:01,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't talk nonsense!</font>

212
00:12:02,240 --> 00:12:04,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We haven't learned that method
of climbing!</font>

213
00:12:04,620 --> 00:12:08,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Right! Chakra control comes after
we've become senior students!</font>

214
00:12:08,990 --> 00:12:13,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That makes no difference.
You can do anything if you get serious!</font>

215
00:12:13,120 --> 00:12:14,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Come on! Let's go!</font>

216
00:12:14,790 --> 00:12:15,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn it...!</font>

217
00:12:21,720 --> 00:12:22,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Grab on!</font>

218
00:12:27,470 --> 00:12:29,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What're you doing?!</font>

219
00:12:29,600 --> 00:12:31,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh! Let go, Konohamaru!</font>

220
00:12:31,810 --> 00:12:33,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If I let go, he'll blow away!</font>

221
00:12:33,980 --> 00:12:35,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let go of the bag, Udon!</font>

222
00:12:35,730 --> 00:12:38,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I can't...!</font>

223
00:12:38,900 --> 00:12:39,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It can't be helped...</font>

224
00:12:39,980 --> 00:12:42,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No! I can't hold on any longer!</font>

225
00:12:48,620 --> 00:12:50,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That was a close one!</font>

226
00:12:51,950 --> 00:12:53,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I issued an evacuation advisory</font>

227
00:12:53,370 --> 00:12:55,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">to all the teams encamped
at the foot of the mountain.</font>

228
00:12:55,460 --> 00:12:58,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I see... Now all that's left is
Naruto's team...</font>

229
00:12:58,880 --> 00:12:59,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Iruka-sensei!</font>

230
00:13:00,840 --> 00:13:03,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I found this on an unplanned route...</font>

231
00:13:03,510 --> 00:13:05,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">An unplanned route, you say?!</font>

232
00:13:10,220 --> 00:13:14,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What do we do now?
We've lost our tent and our food.</font>

233
00:13:15,020 --> 00:13:17,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's no point in saying that!</font>

234
00:13:17,400 --> 00:13:21,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?! It's because you put your foot
on my backpack in the first place...</font>

235
00:13:21,530 --> 00:13:22,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What're you talking about?!</font>

236
00:13:22,740 --> 00:13:24,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If my foot hadn't gotten caught,
we would've blown away.</font>

237
00:13:24,900 --> 00:13:27,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now, now...
Stop fighting.</font>

238
00:13:27,870 --> 00:13:31,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why didn't you close the zipper, Udon?!</font>

239
00:13:31,580 --> 00:13:32,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sorry...</font>

240
00:13:33,000 --> 00:13:35,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now, now...
Don't say that, Konohamaru!</font>

241
00:13:35,370 --> 00:13:36,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">When you get right down to it,</font>

242
00:13:36,540 --> 00:13:39,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">it's your fault for entering
a strange route, Brother Naruto!</font>

243
00:13:39,880 --> 00:13:41,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Right, right!</font>

244
00:13:41,130 --> 00:13:41,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?</font>

245
00:13:42,050 --> 00:13:43,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We got behind because</font>

246
00:13:43,260 --> 00:13:46,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">you got caught in a trap
and were lost forever!</font>

247
00:13:46,720 --> 00:13:48,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, what did you say?!</font>

248
00:13:48,090 --> 00:13:50,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You can't justify yourself, can you?!</font>

249
00:13:50,050 --> 00:13:52,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We could've gotten through faster
if you guys hadn't gotten in the way!</font>

250
00:13:52,890 --> 00:13:55,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's because our leader's
not dependable!</font>

251
00:13:55,180 --> 00:13:56,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?!</font>

252
00:13:57,390 --> 00:13:58,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">How silly!</font>

253
00:13:58,940 --> 00:13:59,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— What did you say?!
— What did you say?!</font>

254
00:14:00,110 --> 00:14:01,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?!</font>

255
00:14:04,690 --> 00:14:07,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm hungry...
Temporary ceasefire.</font>

256
00:14:14,160 --> 00:14:15,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is the spot.</font>

257
00:14:16,330 --> 00:14:17,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That Naruto...</font>

258
00:14:18,170 --> 00:14:20,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">After all I told him about
following instructions!</font>

259
00:14:21,460 --> 00:14:23,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Taking the direction of the wind
under consideration,</font>

260
00:14:23,130 --> 00:14:24,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">they're above here, I guess...</font>

261
00:14:24,340 --> 00:14:25,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay, let's go, Shikamaru.</font>

262
00:14:25,840 --> 00:14:26,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Right.</font>

263
00:14:29,220 --> 00:14:30,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's this?!</font>

264
00:14:31,010 --> 00:14:33,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's all stuff we need hot water for.</font>

265
00:14:33,350 --> 00:14:36,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">About the only thing we can eat
is the baumkuchen cake.</font>

266
00:14:36,560 --> 00:14:38,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm hungry...</font>

267
00:14:38,390 --> 00:14:40,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're asking too much!</font>

268
00:14:40,440 --> 00:14:41,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is survival,</font>

269
00:14:41,810 --> 00:14:44,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">so it's common sense to have things ready
that can be eaten right away!</font>

270
00:14:45,070 --> 00:14:46,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Right, right!</font>

271
00:14:46,440 --> 00:14:48,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I won't share if you're going to complain!</font>

272
00:14:53,330 --> 00:14:55,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm taking the big one.</font>

273
00:14:56,250 --> 00:14:58,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The biggest one... is mine!</font>

274
00:14:59,420 --> 00:15:02,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The big one... The big one...</font>

275
00:15:06,800 --> 00:15:07,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay, eat up!</font>

276
00:15:08,260 --> 00:15:10,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What...? But...</font>

277
00:15:10,720 --> 00:15:12,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's divided in three.</font>

278
00:15:12,510 --> 00:15:15,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're not having any here,
Brother Naruto?</font>

279
00:15:15,430 --> 00:15:16,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Back in the day,</font>

280
00:15:16,520 --> 00:15:20,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I also went without food once
when I screwed up during training.</font>

281
00:15:21,650 --> 00:15:26,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We couldn't all pull together
and Kakashi-sensei got mad at us...</font>

282
00:15:26,320 --> 00:15:30,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Cripes! Who cares about
three working as one?!</font>

283
00:15:31,200 --> 00:15:33,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's called teamwork.</font>

284
00:15:33,780 --> 00:15:35,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I figured it out at that time.</font>

285
00:15:36,660 --> 00:15:41,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The important thing for
a ninja isn't rules or codes,</font>

286
00:15:41,210 --> 00:15:43,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">but teamwork acting for
the sake of comrades.</font>

287
00:15:43,750 --> 00:15:44,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Here.</font>

288
00:15:49,170 --> 00:15:50,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sakura...</font>

289
00:15:55,140 --> 00:15:56,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Brother Naruto...</font>

290
00:15:58,020 --> 00:16:00,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well as for me,
I don't like sweets, so!</font>

291
00:16:02,350 --> 00:16:03,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh...</font>

292
00:16:04,060 --> 00:16:06,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're one to talk
having bought it yourself!</font>

293
00:16:06,570 --> 00:16:08,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Your stomach growled.</font>

294
00:16:08,570 --> 00:16:10,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You have some too, Brother Naruto!</font>

295
00:16:17,030 --> 00:16:19,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's pretty slippery.
You okay, Shikamaru?</font>

296
00:16:19,540 --> 00:16:20,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah...</font>

297
00:16:20,910 --> 00:16:24,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn it... How could that Naruto
take such a dangerous route?!</font>

298
00:16:24,710 --> 00:16:27,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Jeez... He's always causing
some kind of trouble.</font>

299
00:16:27,750 --> 00:16:29,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What a pain he is.</font>

300
00:16:37,140 --> 00:16:39,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It seems they were here
until just a little while ago...</font>

301
00:16:40,390 --> 00:16:45,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He really does cause... trouble.</font>

302
00:16:45,690 --> 00:16:47,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The finish line is right
before our eyes!</font>

303
00:16:48,150 --> 00:16:50,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That method of climbing isn't fair,
I tell you!</font>

304
00:16:50,940 --> 00:16:54,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Right! I knew we shouldn't have
shared the food!</font>

305
00:16:56,950 --> 00:16:57,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What is it, Udon?</font>

306
00:16:57,990 --> 00:17:00,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What are you doing?
We'll leave you behind!</font>

307
00:17:00,910 --> 00:17:03,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Something's... coming...</font>

308
00:17:09,500 --> 00:17:10,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shadow Clone Jutsu!</font>

309
00:17:14,970 --> 00:17:18,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Run while you can!</font>

310
00:17:18,350 --> 00:17:20,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Got it!</font>

311
00:17:23,100 --> 00:17:25,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hurry it up...</font>

312
00:17:26,940 --> 00:17:28,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Brother Naruto!</font>

313
00:17:30,440 --> 00:17:31,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Brother Naruto!</font>

314
00:17:35,990 --> 00:17:39,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Brother! Brother Naruto!
Hang in there!</font>

315
00:17:39,910 --> 00:17:41,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What should we do, Konohamaru?!</font>

316
00:17:41,990 --> 00:17:43,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We'll go help him...</font>

317
00:17:43,750 --> 00:17:47,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But... it looks like
it'll crumble again!</font>

318
00:17:48,630 --> 00:17:51,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Brother Naruto!
Let's go, Udon, Moegi!</font>

319
00:17:58,760 --> 00:18:00,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Are you awake, Brother Naruto?!</font>

320
00:18:06,100 --> 00:18:08,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That was close. So I made it into
a space between the rocks, huh...?</font>

321
00:18:09,270 --> 00:18:11,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We're coming to help!</font>

322
00:18:11,520 --> 00:18:13,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Idiot! Run, quick!</font>

323
00:18:13,440 --> 00:18:15,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Konohamaru...</font>

324
00:18:15,240 --> 00:18:17,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We can't do it...
Let's call for help...</font>

325
00:18:17,490 --> 00:18:19,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Brother said it before!</font>

326
00:18:19,700 --> 00:18:22,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The important thing for
a ninja is teamwork!</font>

327
00:18:23,950 --> 00:18:25,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Konohamaru, you...</font>

328
00:18:26,160 --> 00:18:29,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No! If I move even a little,
the support rock will give way</font>

329
00:18:29,540 --> 00:18:31,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and you guys will end up
getting entangled in this!</font>

330
00:18:31,840 --> 00:18:35,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Brother Naruto! Have you forgotten
what you yourself said?</font>

331
00:18:35,710 --> 00:18:37,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You can do anything...</font>

332
00:18:37,220 --> 00:18:38,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">if you get serious!</font>

333
00:18:40,050 --> 00:18:41,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You guys...</font>

334
00:18:41,350 --> 00:18:44,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Konohamaru Gang!
Help Brother Naruto!</font>

335
00:18:44,560 --> 00:18:45,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah!</font>

336
00:18:57,610 --> 00:18:58,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Be careful!</font>

337
00:18:59,030 --> 00:19:00,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Easy does it!</font>

338
00:19:00,950 --> 00:19:01,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah.</font>

339
00:19:01,990 --> 00:19:03,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But hurry.</font>

340
00:19:09,410 --> 00:19:13,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It moved... Time it right and
toss it away in one shot.</font>

341
00:19:13,420 --> 00:19:14,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Got it!</font>

342
00:19:15,090 --> 00:19:16,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">One, two...!</font>

343
00:19:17,550 --> 00:19:18,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes!</font>

344
00:19:18,670 --> 00:19:20,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's a big success!</font>

345
00:19:20,180 --> 00:19:22,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We did it, we did it!</font>

346
00:19:24,010 --> 00:19:25,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That was a close one...</font>

347
00:19:25,810 --> 00:19:27,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Naruto!
— Naruto!</font>

348
00:19:28,020 --> 00:19:29,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You guys okay?</font>

349
00:19:29,560 --> 00:19:32,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Iruka-sensei! Shikamaru!</font>

350
00:19:32,440 --> 00:19:33,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto! Above you!</font>

351
00:19:37,440 --> 00:19:38,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shadow Clone Jutsu!</font>

352
00:19:40,900 --> 00:19:42,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Run towards Shikamaru!</font>

353
00:19:49,790 --> 00:19:51,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Brother Naruto!</font>

354
00:19:52,500 --> 00:19:53,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto!</font>

355
00:19:55,960 --> 00:19:57,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Rasengan!</font>

356
00:20:02,720 --> 00:20:03,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto...</font>

357
00:20:04,510 --> 00:20:06,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Man, making us get all nervous...</font>

358
00:20:07,260 --> 00:20:09,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Excellent, Brother Naruto...</font>

359
00:20:10,600 --> 00:20:12,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Thank goodness!</font>

360
00:20:12,230 --> 00:20:12,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah!</font>

361
00:20:17,980 --> 00:20:20,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So, what's the meaning of this?</font>

362
00:20:20,690 --> 00:20:22,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So you see...</font>

363
00:20:22,320 --> 00:20:24,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It was all Brother Naruto's orders!</font>

364
00:20:24,780 --> 00:20:26,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We were opposed,</font>

365
00:20:26,870 --> 00:20:29,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">but he forced us to move ahead
saying the only way to finish first</font>

366
00:20:29,910 --> 00:20:32,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">was to take a dangerous shortcut!</font>

367
00:20:32,250 --> 00:20:35,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I said many times we shouldn't
because it's dangerous!</font>

368
00:20:35,880 --> 00:20:36,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But...</font>

369
00:20:37,540 --> 00:20:40,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Team leader Naruto forcibly went ahead!</font>

370
00:20:40,840 --> 00:20:42,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What...? What?</font>

371
00:20:43,510 --> 00:20:47,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It seems that's about the size of it.
You're prepared, right, Naruto?</font>

372
00:20:47,890 --> 00:20:49,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Say...</font>

373
00:20:50,470 --> 00:20:53,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Since when did your teamwork
get so good?</font>

374
00:20:53,560 --> 00:20:54,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto!</font>

375
00:20:55,350 --> 00:20:57,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I've had it with lectures!</font>

376
00:20:57,360 --> 00:20:59,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, wait! Naruto!</font>

377
00:21:00,860 --> 00:21:02,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wait!</font>

378
00:21:19,380 --> 00:21:31,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font color="#eddee0"><font face="Patrick Hand"><font size="27"><b>dokomademo tsudzuku michi ni wa ironna koto arunda ne</b></font></font></font></font>

379
00:21:19,380 --> 00:21:31,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font color="#eddee0"><font face="Patrick Hand"><font size="27"><b>so many things happen on this endless road, right?</b></font></font></font></font>

380
00:21:31,030 --> 00:21:42,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font color="#eddee0"><font face="Patrick Hand"><font size="27"><b>tsuyogari na kimi ga kyou wa juwaki koshi ni namida koe</b></font></font></font></font>

381
00:21:31,030 --> 00:21:42,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font color="#eddee0"><font face="Patrick Hand"><font size="27"><b>although you're strong-willed your voice wavered on the phone today</b></font></font></font></font>

382
00:21:42,630 --> 00:21:53,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font color="#eddee0"><font face="Patrick Hand"><font size="27"><b>donna yume oikakete kokomade kitan darou</b></font></font></font></font>

383
00:21:42,630 --> 00:21:53,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font color="#eddee0"><font face="Patrick Hand"><font size="27"><b>what dreams did you chase to get here?</b></font></font></font></font>

384
00:21:53,420 --> 00:22:05,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font color="#eddee0"><font face="Patrick Hand"><font size="27"><b>wakara na kunattari suru koto wa boku ni datte aru kara nee BABY</b></font></font></font></font>

385
00:21:53,420 --> 00:22:05,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font color="#eddee0"><font face="Patrick Hand"><font size="27"><b>even I have times when I just don't understand baby</b></font></font></font></font>

386
00:22:05,760 --> 00:22:17,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font color="#eddee0"><font face="Patrick Hand"><font size="27"><b>kimi ga namida no toki ni wa boku ga soba ni iru kara</b></font></font></font></font>

387
00:22:05,760 --> 00:22:17,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font color="#eddee0"><font face="Patrick Hand"><font size="27"><b>when you're sad I'll be close to you</b></font></font></font></font>

388
00:22:17,280 --> 00:22:28,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font color="#eddee0"><font face="Patrick Hand"><font size="27"><b>hanareba nare no yoru datte boku wa soba ni iru kara</b></font></font></font></font>

389
00:22:17,280 --> 00:22:28,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font color="#eddee0"><font face="Patrick Hand"><font size="27"><b>even on nights when we're apart I'll be close to you</b></font></font></font></font>

390
00:22:28,880 --> 00:22:34,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font color="#eddee0"><font face="Patrick Hand"><font size="27"><b>boku wa soba ni iru kara</b></font></font></font></font>

391
00:22:28,880 --> 00:22:34,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font color="#eddee0"><font face="Patrick Hand"><font size="27"><b>I'll be close to you</b></font></font></font></font>

392
00:22:40,000 --> 00:22:43,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">A thin giant that appeared from the green wilds!</font>

393
00:22:44,050 --> 00:22:45,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Two Japanese short swords hanging from his waist.</font>

394
00:22:45,880 --> 00:22:47,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">A vagabond bounty hunter!</font>

395
00:22:47,920 --> 00:22:49,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">A big game hunter!</font>

396
00:22:49,510 --> 00:22:51,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">An atrocious thief!</font>

397
00:22:51,760 --> 00:22:53,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">A fierce battle pursuing and being pursued!</font>

398
00:22:53,260 --> 00:22:55,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">And the voice that halts it!</font>

399
00:22:55,310 --> 00:22:58,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Hey, hey, hey! That thief, there's my prey!</font>

400
00:22:59,060 --> 00:23:02,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Uzumaki Naruto, now on stage!</font>

401
00:23:02,610 --> 00:23:06,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Next time:
"Friend or Foe?! Bounty Hunter of the Wild."</font>

